## Model card

- **Name:** North Mini Code
- **Short description:** Cohere's coding model (launched 2026-06-09) for practical software engineering and agentic edits, open weights with a 256K context and an explicit reasoning mode.
- **Provider / access:** Cohere (`cohere/north-mini-code-1-0`), plus ~1 route. Open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-06-09; knowledge cutoff 2025-09-23 (models.dev).
- **IDs:** `north_mini_code`, `cohere/north-mini-code-1-0`.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens; max output 64,000.
- **Modalities:** text in / text out; reasoning mode; tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** catalogue shows $0/$0 (open weights).
- **Architecture:** open-weight (Cohere; undisclosed size).

